{"id":"vod_md_6314","vodId":"6314","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"我的英雄学院第三季","name_cn":"我的英雄学院第三季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231026-1/91d208b38d030ed3783220453a69cd2e.jpg"},"summary":"拥有名为“个性”的超常能力的人类的存在变得理所当然的世界。与No.1英雄·欧尔麦特相遇了的“无个性”少年·绿谷出久，小出他的隐藏的英雄资质被发现，并继承了欧尔麦特的“个性”——ONE FOR ALL。而后小出成功地进入了英雄辈出的名门校·雄英高校，与同学们过着互相比试切磋琢磨的每一天。雄英高校的学生们激烈比试的大活动「雄英体育祭」、在职业英雄手下磨练技艺的「职场体验」、与“英雄杀手”斯坦因的死斗、期末考试中与欧尔麦特的战斗，然后是与敌联合的死柄木吊的邂逅…。在一个个试炼面前，目标着成为职业英雄而果敢的站了出来的出久。另一方，死柄木与欧尔麦特的宿敌·ALL FOR ONE的同伴也增加了，并伺机蠢蠢欲动。为了成为最棒的英雄的出久的步伐、以及与敌人们的战斗，日渐加速！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-26 08:23:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/Kns5cWbj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/tkh7tmRE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/Y1kkOEZc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/ggbMZHKN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/ZtB28j7P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/jxkNpIWh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/8DbwIdS5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/TLSh5LiR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/F8M3UV4E/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/zS4aG0op/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/GjJUsbyz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/YmBarVFB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/WEvibWgB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231025/M1ywbBrn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://p